# Ad Nauseam: with no card in the library there is nothing to reveal (CR 701.20, 400.3), so no life is lost and the
# spell simply ends. Bot1's whole deck is its opening hand, so the library is empty when it casts (turn 1 has no draw).
# The positive control is the neighbouring scenario, which reveals with cards in the library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Ad Nauseam
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

